   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2021-07-15",
   "text": "Freedom to Compete Act\n This bill prohibits an employer from enforcing, or threatening to enforce, any non-compete agreement in employment contracts with certain entry level, lower wage workers. A non-compete agreement entered into before the enactment of this bill shall be void and have no effect."
  }
